# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Vercel 部署环境变量配置
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ============================================================================
# 前端环境变量 (Frontend Environment Variables)
# 这些变量在 Vercel 项目设置中配置，用于构建时注入到前端代码
# ============================================================================

# OAuth 配置
VITE_OAUTH_PORTAL_URL=https://oauth.manus.computer
VITE_APP_ID=your_app_id_here

# API 基础 URL（指向 Vercel Serverless Functions）
# 生产环境使用相对路径 /api，开发环境可指定完整 URL
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# ============================================================================
# 后端环境变量 (Backend Environment Variables - Serverless Functions)
# 这些变量在 Vercel 项目设置中配置，用于 Serverless Functions 运行时
# ============================================================================

# 数据库配置 (阿里云 MySQL)
DATABASE_URL=mysql://username:password@your-aliyun-mysql-host:3306/realsourcing

# 应用配置
NODE_ENV=production
APP_URL=https://your-domain.vercel.app
CORS_ORIGIN=https://your-domain.vercel.app

# JWT 密钥
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key_change_this_in_production

# OAuth 配置
OAUTH_SERVER_URL=https://oauth.manus.computer
OWNER_OPEN_ID=your_owner_open_id

# 声网配置 (Agora)
AGORA_APP_ID=your_agora_app_id
AGORA_CERTIFICATE=your_agora_certificate
AGORA_CUSTOMER_ID=your_agora_customer_id
AGORA_CUSTOMER_SECRET=your_agora_customer_secret

# 阿里云 OSS 配置
OSS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your_oss_access_key_id
OSS_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET=your_oss_access_key_secret
OSS_BUCKET=realsourcing-production
OSS_REGION=oss-cn-shenzhen
OSS_ENDPOINT=https://oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com
OSS_CDN_DOMAIN=

# Nova AI 配置
NOVA_API_KEY=your_nova_api_key
NOVA_API_BASE_URL=https://api.nova-ai.com

# 支付配置
ALIPAY_APP_ID=your_alipay_app_id
ALIPAY_PRIVATE_KEY=your_alipay_private_key
ALIPAY_PUBLIC_KEY=your_alipay_public_key
ALIPAY_GATEWAY=https://openapi.alipay.com/gateway.do

WECHAT_MERCHANT_ID=your_wechat_merchant_id
WECHAT_API_KEY=your_wechat_api_key
WECHAT_APP_ID=your_wechat_app_id
WECHAT_APP_SECRET=your_wechat_app_secret

# 邮件配置
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=noreply@realsourcing.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_smtp_password
SMTP_FROM=noreply@realsourcing.com

# Redis 配置（可选）
REDIS_URL=

# 监控配置（可选）
SENTRY_DSN=
GA_TRACKING_ID=

# 内置 Forge API（Manus 平台）
BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_URL=
BUILT_IN_FORGE_API_KEY=
